From 577844daecb632aaccbcc8b83374bf9d55081284 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wild8highlander <aslan08_05@mail.ru>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 17:16:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: pin all actions to full-length commit SHAs (fix required
 policy)

All jobs in CI/Pages were failing instantly with:
'the actions are not allowed because all actions must be pinned
to a full-length commit SHA'

- actions/checkout            v4       -> 3d3c42e5 (v7.0.1)
- actions/setup-python        v5       -> 5fda3b95 (v7.0.0)
- actions/configure-pages     v5       -> 45bfe019 (v6.0.0)
- actions/upload-pages-artifact v3     -> fc324d35 (v5.0.0)
- actions/deploy-pages        v4       -> 368f8252 (v5.0.1)
- softprops/action-gh-release v2       -> efb35369 (v3.0.3)

Also fix stale project metadata in pyproject.toml:
- package name research-papers -> navier-stokes-b
- Homepage/Documentation/Repository/Issues -> navier-stokes-b URLs

Regenerate MANIFEST.json after the tree change.
---
 .github/workflows/ci.yml      | 16 +++---
 .github/workflows/pages.yml   |  8 +--
 .github/workflows/release.yml |  6 +--
 MANIFEST.json                 | 92 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 pyproject.toml                | 12 ++---
 5 files changed, 105 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

